Template: campus-wifi-autologin/netid
Type: string
Description: PENS NetID:
 Enter the NetID you use to log in to the eepiswlan captive portal.
 .
 Leave this empty to configure it later with:
 sudo campus-wifi-autologin setup

Template: campus-wifi-autologin/password
Type: password
Description: Password for this NetID:
 The password is stored in /etc/campus-wifi-autologin/config, which only
 root can read. It is removed from the debconf database right after
 installation.
